SUMMARY:Steven Ho: Not Your Comedy Hero Tour
LOCATION:The Comedy Loft of DC\, 1523 22nd St NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:​Steven Ho is a former ER Technician turned stand-up comedian
  and content creator whose comedy brings the wild world of healthcare to t
 he stage and screen. Best known for his viral “Tips from the ER” serie
 s\, Steven has built a community of over 14 million fans across his platfo
 rms. Steven blends sharp storytelling\, real-life ER chaos\, and the hilar
 ious submissions he receives from his audiences—true hospital stories th
 at range from unbelievable patient moments to “things people definitely 
 shouldn’t put up there.” Between tour stops\, Steven continues to post
  weekly sketches featuring a cast of recurring fan-favorite characters lik
 e Betty\, the overly confident Gen Z nurse\, and Nurse Austin\, the gentle
  optimist. His mix of absurdity\, authenticity\, and heart has made him on
 e of the most recognizable comedic voices in the medical and online comedy
  worlds.\n\nPlease note\, there is a 2 item per person minimum in the showr
